# EXE

- `build_exe.bat` must produce `dist/Crypto-AI-Master-Intelligence.exe` (PyInstaller).
- The EXE starts the local API, serves the built UI, and opens the desktop window.
- Missing GPU, missing API keys, or missing optional packages must not prevent launch.
- Bundle the React build output and the SQLite schema bootstrap. Do not require users to run Vite in production.
- Never bake API keys into the binary. Read `.env` next to the EXE.
